\end_inset


\end_layout

\begin_layout Plain Layout
\begin_inset Caption

\begin_layout Plain Layout
Although a clear sine wave is produced from sampling the signal shown above
 in red, there are several points missed in-between each of the data points.
 This misrepresentation of the original signal is called aliasing.
 
